generate` on a settled overlay, the emitter recompiled against them; with the new emitter `DrakeCLI check` reads
surface drift 0, json drift 0 over main and mods — every surface byte-identical. ActorAspectTest (5) is the 81st
suite: the layout in canonical order with each elision; role as presence; the message type bare in the own package
and qualified elsewhere, through the live emitter and back; EVERY actor section of the main and mods corpus reproduced
